## Model card (identity resolution)

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Flash Lite (`qwen-3.5-flash-lite`) — **not a released Qwen SKU.** The Qwen 3.5 Medium Model Series, announced by @Alibaba_Qwen on 2026-02-24/25, consists of exactly four members: **Qwen3.5-Flash, Qwen3.5-35B-A3B, Qwen3.5-122B-A10B, Qwen3.5-27B** ("More intelligence, less compute"). No Lite tier was announced, and none appears anywhere since.
- **Provider / access:** none — no Model Studio id, no OpenRouter id, no Hugging Face/ModelScope repo, no third-party host found.
- **Release / knowledge:** n/a — never released.
- **IDs:** none found. The real hosted tier is `qwen3.5-flash` (Feb 25, 2026; snapshot `qwen3.5-flash-2026-02-23`; OpenRouter `qwen/qwen3.5-flash-02-23`; $0.065/$0.26 OpenRouter, $0.10/$0.40 Model Studio International, 1M context, hosted counterpart of the open Qwen3.5-35B-A3B).
- **Context window:** n/a.
- **Modalities:** n/a. (Real Qwen3.5-Flash: vision-language, text/image/video in per aggregators.)
- **Pricing:** n/a.
- **Architecture:** n/a.

